  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si on l’attaque, il projette un nuage de\ncoton. L’ennemi le confond avec lui, ce\nqui permet à Doudouvet de s’enfuir.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When attacked, it escapes by shooting\ncotton from its body. The cotton serves\nas a decoy to distract the attacker.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il dérive librement au gré du vent.\nLes jours de pluie, il s’alourdit et\nse réfugie au pied des arbres.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They go wherever the wind takes them.\nOn rainy days, their bodies are heavier,\nso they take shelter beneath big trees.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Perhaps because they feel more at ease\nin a group, they stick to others they\nfind. They end up looking like a cloud.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Perhaps because they feel more at ease\nin a group, they stick to others they\nfind. They end up looking like a cloud.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おそわれると　からだから　わたを\nとばす。てきが　わたを　モンメンと\nまちがえている　すきに　にげるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "공격당하면 몸에서 솜을\n날린다. 상대가 솜을 소미안으로\n착각하고 있는 동안 도망친다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si on l’attaque, il projette un nuage de coton.\nL’ennemi le confond avec lui, ce qui permet à\nDoudouvet de s’enfuir.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wird es angegriffen, verstreut es zur Täuschung\nWatte. Es flieht, während der Gegner nach dem\nwahren Waumboll sucht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Despide motas de algodón cuando lo atacan para\nconfundir a los enemigos y poner pies en polvorosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se viene attaccato crea una nuvola di cotone per\nconfondere il nemico, poi ne approfitta per fuggire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When attacked, it escapes by shooting cotton from\nits body. The cotton serves as a decoy to distract\nthe attacker.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "襲われると　体から　綿を　飛ばす。\n敵が　綿を　モンメンと\n間違えている　すきに　逃げるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Despide motas de algodón cuando lo atacan para\nconfundir a los enemigos y poner pies en polvorosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "しゅうだんで　いると　おちつくのか\nなかまを　みつけると　くっついて\nいつのまにか　くものように　なる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "집단으로 있으면 편안한지\n동료를 발견하면 달라붙어\n어느새 구름처럼 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pokémon à l’instinct grégaire, ils se collent les uns\naux autres et finissent par former un gros nuage.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sind sie mit Freunden unterwegs, hängen sie eng\naufeinander wie Wolken, wohl weil sie sich in der\nGruppe sicherer fühlen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quizá por el hecho de que se relajan al estar con\nlos suyos, forman un grupo al encontrar amigos y\nparecen nubes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si sentono più sicuri in gruppo, e quando incontrano\ni loro simili non li lasciano più formando come una\ngrande nuvola.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Perhaps because they feel more at ease in a group,\nthey stick to others they find. They end up looking\nlike a cloud.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "集団で　いると　落ち着くのか\n仲間を　みつけると　くっついて\nいつのまにか　雲のように　なる。",
